        <rule id="7123-8f5c-d00a-c642" name="Special Order: Hunker Down" hidden="false">
          <description>The active model gains the Solid and Tough keywords until the end of the round, but it may not perform a sprint action at any point during this activation. The model does not need to test for Rampage this Round.</description>
