      <rules>
        <rule id="2583-9dd7-e778-615e" name="Special Order: Force Push" hidden="false">
          <description>Choose one enemy model (without the Solid, Vehicle or Walker keyword) within Range 2, LoS and of the same size or less of the active friendly model. The target enemy model is thrown 1 cube directly away from the active friendly model and placed by the owning player. This will not trigger any Break Away assault. If the cube entered contains a model not of their own strike team, this will initiate an Assault but the moving model may only roll a Survive test. If blocked by a wall, resolve Slammed into Walls as normal. May not result in Overstacking.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
